*
!apps/
!apps/shared-lib/
!apps/shared-lib/**
!apps/hub-api/
!apps/hub-api/**
!apps/docs-api/
!apps/docs-api/**
!apps/retrieval-worker/
!apps/retrieval-worker/**
!apps/ingestion-worker/
!apps/ingestion-worker/**
# The web app (apps/web/Dockerfile) also builds from the repo root. Re-include its source
# but NOT node_modules / .next — the image does a fresh `npm ci` + build, and copying the
# host's node_modules would clobber it (and bloats the context). Later patterns win, so
# these two exclusions strip those dirs back out of the re-included tree.
!apps/web/
!apps/web/**
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
# db/Dockerfile (the compose migrate service) builds from the repo root and copies
# db/migrate.py + db/migrations — without these re-includes its COPY steps fail.
!db/
!db/**
# Exclude infra directories with venv to speed up build context
infra/
